local function the cad mesh singular target on {cad surface:surfaceValue} of face {cad face:faceValue} along axis {integer:varyingAxis} from {a 64 bit floating-point number:baseValue} over {a 64 bit floating-point number:periodValue} with bound {a 64 bit floating-point number:boundValue} and traversal {a 64 bit floating-point number:traversalValue} within {a 64 bit floating-point number:linearTolerance}:
