local function the cad mesh band fill of {cad mesh boundary band:bandValue} on {cad surface:surfaceValue} of face {cad face:faceValue} within angle {a 64 bit floating-point number:maxAngle} and tolerance {a 64 bit floating-point number:linearTolerance}:
