        return the cad silhouette identity of (planarIdentity as a 64 bit integer) and pointValue's z in (the spatial of tables) counting slot 1 among (the counts of tables)

local function cad silhouette remember side from {cad vector3:firstPosition} to {cad vector3:secondPosition} with normal {cad vector3:normalValue} in group {a 64 bit integer:groupValue} relative to {cad vector3:originValue} within {a 64 bit floating-point number:precisionValue} using {a pointer to a cad silhouette side tables:tables}, open {a pointer to a list:openValues} and output {a pointer to a list:sideValues}:
